{"id":"d9c89f9cbb8a42f2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-label-cover.md","title":"LABEL-COVER","display":"df-label-cover — LABEL-COVER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-label-cover","aliases":["28-df-label-cover","LABEL-COVER"],"display":"df-label-cover — LABEL-COVER","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.3, projection property and LABEL-COVER discussion","source_printed_pages":"472–473,494","source_pdf_pages":"498–499,520","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-label-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-label-cover</span><span>LABEL-COVER</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-label-cover — LABEL-COVER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.3, projection property and LABEL-COVER discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"472–473,494"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"498–499,520"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为有限不交集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq U\\times V\">\\(E\\subseteq U\\times V\\)</span> 非空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V\">\\(\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V\\)</span> 为有限非空标签集。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in E\">\\(e\\in E\\)</span> 给定总函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_e:\\Sigma_U\\to\\Sigma_V\">\\(\\pi_e:\\Sigma_U\\to\\Sigma_V\\)</span>；实例为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(U,V,E,\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V,(\\pi_e)_{e\\in E})\">\\(\\mathcal L=(U,V,E,\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V,(\\pi_e)_{e\\in E})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\ell_U\\in\\Sigma_U^U,\\ell_V\\in\\Sigma_V^V}\\frac{|\\{(u,v)\\in E:\\pi_{(u,v)}(\\ell_U(u))=\\ell_V(v)\\}|}{|E|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\ell_U\\in\\Sigma_U^U,\\ell_V\\in\\Sigma_V^V}\\frac{|\\{(u,v)\\in E:\\pi_{(u,v)}(\\ell_U(u))=\\ell_V(v)\\}|}{|E|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>对每个左标签，投影总函数指定恰好一个右标签。若允许部分投影或加权多重边，需另改实例签名；本节点固定简单二部图等权版本。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§22.3, projection property and LABEL-COVER discussion，印刷页 472–473,494；PDF 页 498–499,520。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq U\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_e:\\Sigma_U\\to\\Sigma_V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(U,V,E,\\Sigma_U,\\Sigma_V,(\\pi_e)_{e\\in E})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\ell_U\\in\\Sigma_U^U,\\ell_V\\in\\Sigma_V^V}\\frac{|\\{(u,v)\\in E:\\pi_{(u,v)}(\\ell_U(u))=\\ell_V(v)\\}|}{|E|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1398,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"近似与约束：[[28-df-approximation-ratio]]、[[28-df-label-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}